                "text": "CVE-2023-44487 high vulnerability for libnghttp2-14 package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Version 1.40.0-1build1 is affected with an available fix in versions 1.40.0-1ubuntu0.2"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487\nSeverity: high\nPackage: libnghttp2-14\nVersion: 1.40.0-1build1\nFix Version: 1.40.0-1ubuntu0.2\nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:20.04\nLink: [CVE-2023-44487](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2023-44487)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | libnghttp2-14  | 1.40.0-1build1  | 1.40.0-1ubuntu0.2  | deb  | /var/lib/dpkg/status  | ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:20.04  | [CVE-2023-44487](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2023-44487)  |\n"
              },
