            {
              "id": "CVE-2022-41717-stdlib",
              "name": "GoModuleMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2022-41717 medium vulnerability for stdlib package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An attacker can cause excessive memory growth in a Go server accepting HTTP/2 requests. HTTP/2 server connections contain a cache of HTTP header keys sent by the client. While the total number of entries in this cache is capped, an attacker sending very large keys can cause the server to allocate approximately 64 MiB per open connection."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-41717\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.17.7\nFix Version: 1.18.9,1.19.4\nType: go-module\nLocation: /opt/local/bin/istio-cni-taint\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2022-41717](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-41717)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2022-41717**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| medium  | stdlib  | go1.17.7  | 1.18.9,1.19.4  | go-module  | /opt/local/bin/istio-cni-taint  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2022-41717](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-41717)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:golang/stdlib@1.17.7"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.3"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2024-24790-stdlib",
              "name": "GoModuleMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2024-24790 critical vulnerability for stdlib package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The various Is methods (IsPrivate, IsLoopback, etc) did not work as expected for IPv4-mapped IPv6 addresses, returning false for addresses which would return true in their traditional IPv4 forms."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
