                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-24539\nSeverity: high\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.17.7\nFix Version: 1.19.9,1.20.4\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/install-cni\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2023-24539](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-24539)",
